---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
---
<Base title="Custom basketball apps"><section class="section page-head"><span class="eyebrow section-kicker">Your workflow. Your tool.</span><h1>Need a tool that<br/>doesn’t exist yet?</h1><p>Custom basketball tools built for coaches at every level. Start with the question your staff needs to answer.</p></section><section class="section request-layout"><div><div class="process"><div><span>01</span><h3>Tell me what you track.</h3><p>Your workflow, the stats your staff cares about, and how you use them on game day.</p></div><div><span>02</span><h3>I build it.</h3><p>A tool shaped around your system, terminology and staff.</p></div><div><span>03</span><h3>Use it, then refine it.</h3><p>Test it in real games and practices, then tweak it from your feedback.</p></div></div><p style="font-size:14px;margin:30px 0;color:var(--muted)">The Live Play Call Tracker’s latest update was built straight from coaches’ feedback.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://stan.store/JacksonDavis/p/custom-apps?utm_source=site&utm_medium=custom_apps&utm_campaign=custom-apps" data-stan="custom-apps">Prefer Stan? Submit your request ($30) <Icon name="diagonal" size={17}/></a><p class="fineprint"><a href="https://stan.store/JacksonDavis/p/custom-apps">Full details on Stan ↗</a></p></div><form class="request-form" id="request-form"><h3>Your next tool starts here.</h3><p class="form-note">Prepare your brief, then share it through Stan.</p><div class="form-pair"><label>Name<input name="name" required minlength="2" maxlength="100" autocomplete="name"/></label><label>Email<input name="email" type="email" required autocomplete="email"/></label></div><label>Your role<select name="role" required><option value="">Choose your role</option><option>Head coach</option><option>Assistant coach</option><option>Video & analytics</option><option>Recruiting</option><option>Other</option></select></label><label>Program & level (optional)<input name="program" maxlength="120"/></label><label>What do you want to track?<textarea name="whatYouTrack" required minlength="20" maxlength="3000" placeholder="Your workflow, the stats that matter, and how you use them…"></textarea></label><div class="form-pair"><label>Timeline (optional)<input name="timeline" maxlength="100"/></label><label>Budget range (optional)<input name="budget" maxlength="100"/></label></div><div hidden><label>Leave this field empty<input name="company_website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"/></label></div><label class="checkbox"><input name="consent" type="checkbox" required/>I understand this prepares a brief to share through Stan. My details are not saved on this website.</label><button class="button" type="submit">Prepare my request <Icon name="arrow" size={17}/></button><p role="status" id="request-status" aria-live="polite"></p><pre class="request-output" id="request-output" hidden></pre><div id="request-handoff" hidden><button type="button" class="button button-outline" id="copy-request">Copy request brief</button><a class="text-link" href="https://stan.store/JacksonDavis/p/custom-apps" data-stan="custom-apps">Open Stan request page <Icon name="diagonal" size={17}/></a></div><noscript><p class="fineprint">Use the Stan request link to send your brief directly to Jackson.</p></noscript></form></section></Base>
